}
(e.g. {.i naku broda gi'e brode}) is relative to the simple statement. x1
broda x2 =3D=3D P(x1,x2); x1 broda x2 gi'e brode x3 =3D=3D P(x1,x2) ^ Q(x1,=
x2); x1
broda x2 gi'e na[i] brode x3 =3D=3D P(x1,x2) ^ ~Q(x1,x2). "Q(x1,x2)" is the
